                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3396ee62-169b-3193-9595-9d3079bfd3fb",
                        "entry_id": "0cbd717f-2e42-3889-83e2-686af7d8c0b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hypothetical device consisting of a traversable portal (typically a wormhole) that can send one to another location light years away nearly instantaneously."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "545118a9-f85f-4cef-9ef0-162830f5586c",
                                "sense_id": "3396ee62-169b-3193-9595-9d3079bfd3fb",
                                "text": "Find examples of stargates and wormholes in the ancient world […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3d4e25c-e007-4f0d-bb94-7ab5b6253df5",
                                "sense_id": "3396ee62-169b-3193-9595-9d3079bfd3fb",
                                "text": "Perhaps the first clear depiction of a stargate is to be found in Robert Heinlein's classic novel Tunnel in the Sky […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efaf19d0-b319-4773-8dcf-9144b2ed403f",
                                "sense_id": "3396ee62-169b-3193-9595-9d3079bfd3fb",
                                "text": "A stargate takes you to that star or constellation. […] The opening of a stargate requires the participation of the Archangel Michael […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "995835f3-8ff1-4cc3-8d73-8a9689ed0707",
                                "sense_id": "3396ee62-169b-3193-9595-9d3079bfd3fb",
                                "text": "At some point it might be possible to devise a \"stargate\" such as depicted in the movies 2001: A Space Odyssey and Stargate […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0194df4-c3b0-49b5-ba2b-4d6ed9a6debd",
                                "sense_id": "3396ee62-169b-3193-9595-9d3079bfd3fb",
                                "text": "With a stargate, travel is instantaneous. It is quite possible that the secret government either has a stargate or is trying to get one."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
